        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Neck pain with intermittent sharp/electric pain radiating to the left shoulder, dorsal forearm, and index/middle fingers, with paraesthesia in the same distribution; symptoms present for approximately 3–4 months and worsening."
