          "text": "Neck examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reduced neck range of motion, especially extension and left rotation, with pain. Tender lower cervical paraspinals and left trapezius; no midline tenderness. Left Spurling test positive, reproducing arm pain and paraesthesia."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
