          "text": "Upper limb neurological examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Left triceps power 4+/5; all other tested power 5/5. Left triceps reflex decreased; other reflexes 2+ and symmetrical. Light touch decreased over left index and middle fingers."
      }
    },
